---
---
<section id="about" class="relative bg-white py-16 md:py-28 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-20 items-center">

      <!-- Left: Narrative -->
      <div>
        <p class="text-gold text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-5">About</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-navy leading-tight mb-6">
          Ten Years In.<br />Still Building.
        </h2>
        <div class="w-12 h-0.5 bg-gold mb-8"></div>

        <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-5">
          Jordan Gisch has spent over a decade at the center of retail media — from the early days of Amazon advertising at CPC Strategy and Tinuiti, to leading $40M+ in annual ad spend, to directing strategy across Amazon, Walmart, Target, Instacart, and CitrusAd for enterprise brands.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-5">
          After years leading teams inside some of the most respected agencies in the space, GISCH was built on a simple premise: the brands that need it most deserve a partner who is genuinely in it with them — not a junior contact with a senior price tag.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          We work with a select group of brands. Every engagement is led by Jordan directly. No handoffs. No account managers. Just deep expertise and a relentless focus on results.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          {['Amazon', 'Walmart Connect', 'Target Roundel', 'Instacart', 'CitrusAd', 'Amazon AMC', 'Criteo', 'Chewy'].map((platform) => (
            <span class="border border-gold/30 text-gold text-xs font-medium px-4 py-2 rounded-sm tracking-wide">
              {platform}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Credential Cards -->
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <div class="bg-navy rounded-sm p-8 border-l-4 border-gold">
          <div class="font-display text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-2">10+</div>
          <div class="text-white/50 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide">Years in retail media &amp; Amazon advertising</div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-cream rounded-sm p-8 border-l-4 border-gold">
          <div class="font-display text-5xl font-bold text-navy mb-2">$40M+</div>
          <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide">In annual ad spend managed across major retail media networks</div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-cream rounded-sm p-8 border-l-4 border-gold">
          <div class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-2">Enterprise to Emerging</div>
          <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide">Strategy and execution across Baby, Beauty, Grocery, Fashion, Consumer Electronics &amp; more</div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-navy rounded-sm p-6 flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold flex-shrink-0"></div>
          <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <span class="text-white font-semibold">Amazon Accredited Advertiser</span> — built strategies that achieved 85%+ conversion rates in retail media pilots
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Diagonal transition to navy Services section -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 leading-none">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 80" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none" style="display:block;width:100%;height:80px;">
      <path d="M0,0 L1440,80 L0,80 Z" fill="#0D1B2A" />
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>
